<title>USA: Knox County, Tenn., $9.6 mln deal postponed.</title>
<headline>Knox County, Tenn., $9.6 mln deal postponed.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Public Building Authority of Knox County, Tenn., has postponed its $9.6 million lease rental revenue bond deal, originally slated for 1100 EDT Thursday, the authority's financial adviser said.</p>
<p>No new date has been set, according to Cumberland Securities Co Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
